-- Route B (mm0-pa-ha) node B4b: the Pi2 forms of K215 Theorem 2, Theorem 3 and G2, over
-- the proved K215 roots. Proof: b4b_final.mm1 (the `_of` forms applied to
-- ZFC_consistent_iff_BB215_no_value_provable_final, K215_full_consistency_BB215_nonprovability_final,
-- ZFC_second_incompleteness_K215Pr_inc). Statements: the approved text of b4/b4b_statements.mm0.
-- K215_thm2_pi2b is stated in b4b_bb.mm0 and K215_sigma1 / K215_sigma2 in b4_final.mm0.
import "zfc_incompleteness_root.mm0";
import "b4_final.mm0";
import "b4b_bb.mm0";
import "b4g2_final.mm0";

--| Theorem 2, (->): a ZFC proof of some value sentence gives a ZFC proof of falsity.
theorem K215_thm2_pi2a {u w: nat}: $ A. u (bdBB215Prf u -> E. w bdZfcBot w) $;

--| Theorem 3, second conjunct (->): a halting run gives a ZFC proof of some value sentence.
theorem K215_thm3_pi2a {h u: nat}: $ A. h (bdK215Halt h -> E. u bdBB215Prf u) $;
--| Theorem 3, second conjunct (<-): a ZFC proof of some value sentence gives a halting run.
theorem K215_thm3_pi2b {u h: nat}: $ A. u (bdBB215Prf u -> E. h bdK215Halt h) $;

--| G2: a ZFC proof of Con(ZFC) gives a ZFC proof of falsity.
theorem K215_G2_pi2 {u w: nat}: $ A. u (bdZfcConPrf u -> E. w bdZfcBot w) $;
